-(`createService(...).withRPC()`), not raw Hono. It mounts a public REST surface at `/api/v1/auth/*`
-and the equivalent oRPC surface at `/api/rpc/v1/auth/*`, plus standard `/health/live` and
-`/health/ready` probes.
