+## Summary
+
+This PR removes the auth plugin's collision with consumer Prisma model names, makes plugin schema
+merges reject different-body declarations and deduplicate identical ones, and promotes decisive
+production E2E errors into the GitHub annotation and step summary.
+
+The real cause of #1058 is a name collision between two different models: the scaffold example
+`User` generated by `--service-name users`, and better-auth's plugin model `User`. It is not a
+duplicated fetched fragment.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Archetypes / areas: CLI/tooling, plugin, auth integration, database diagnostics
