ins/auth/auth.prisma:17:model Session {\ndatabase/postgres/schema/plugins/auth/auth.prisma:33:model Account {\ndatabase/postgres/schema/plugins/auth/auth.prisma:55:model Verification {\ndatabase/postgres/schema/schema.prisma:17:model User {\n```\n\n## Slices\n\n- [x] Namespace auth Prisma identifiers while preserving physical `auth_*` table mappings and\n      configure better-auth with camelCase Prisma client accessors.\n- [x] Reject different-body top-level Prisma declarations and deduplicate identical declarations at\n      the root-schema write boundary.\n- [x] Prove both collision paths RED before implementation and GREEN afterward without editing the\n      two #1043 dependency-mode tests.\n- [x] Surface decisive production E2E errors before filtered tails and emit GitHub annotation and\n      step-summary text.\n- [x] Reproduce the original failure and validate the formatter against failed run 30743141553.\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n- [x] Auth schema declares `AuthUser`, `AuthSession`, `AuthAccount`, and `AuthVerification` only.\n- [x] All `@@map(\"auth_*\")` physical table mappings remain unchanged.\n- [x] better-auth defaults use `authUser`, `authSession`, `authAccount`, and `authVerification`, with\n      caller override precedence tested.\n- [x] Different-body collisions throw a named `ScaffoldValidationError` with plugin, fragment,\n      declaration, and existing path.\n- [x] Identical declarations are idempotent and appear once.\n- [x] `--service-name users` and existing E2E assertions remain unchanged.\n- [x] Requested tests and standard gates are green.\n- [x] No release/canary workflow was dispatched and no merge was performed.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `deno task check` — PASS (2,510 files, 21 batches, 0 diagnostics)\n- `deno task lint` — PASS (1,744 files, 0 findings)\n- `deno task fmt:check` — PASS (1,893 files, 0 findings)\n- `deno task quality:gate` — PASS\n- `deno test -A packages/cli/src/kernel/adapters/plugin/db-integration_test.ts packages/cli/src/public/features/plugins/install/install-plugin_test.ts` — PASS (9 tests / 21 steps)\n- `deno test -A .llm/tools/e2e/print-failed-report-steps_test.ts` — PASS (4 tests)\n- auth adapter/schema focused tests — PASS (12 tests)\n- CLI, auth-better-auth, and plugin-auth JSR audits — PASS (dry-run OK)\n- local branch CLI + workspace auth reproduction — PASS; every materialized model declared once\n\n## Harness\n\n- Run dir: `.llm/runs/fix-1058--supervisor/slices/s1/`\n- Phase: `impl-eval`\n- Owner waiver: open-model Plan-Gate evaluator waived 2026-08-01; supervisor owns PLAN-EVAL and\n  IMPL-EVAL. No `plan-eval.md` was fabricated.\n\n## Drift / Debt\n\n- No new architecture debt. Collision modules were consolidated to keep\n  `kernel/adapters/plugin` at the 12-child doctrine cap.\n- Known local-path schema omission #1043/#1014 is unchanged and out of scope.\n","headRefOid":"5b9286cd8c786a84fc4a37064474b5dfaab205ea","isDraft":true,"labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoEUaLw","name":"type:fix","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoEUaNA","name":"area:cli","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoE0mTA","name":"status:impl-eval","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoN_J8Q","name":"area:auth","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACp3ynyQ","name":"gate:e2e","description":"","color":"d4c5f9"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACp6nO2g","name":"priority:p0","description":"Critical / release blocker","color":"b60205"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACp6nQQg","name":"area:database","description":"packages/database and adapters","color":"bfdadc"}],"milestone":{"number":15,"title":"0.0.3","description":"Fixes-only stabilisation release. Defects found by the round-two agent build experiment plus release and tooling fixes. No feature work — Process Manager core, the frontend contribution layer and deploy plugin W1-W3 moved to 0.0.4.","dueOn":null},"number":1059,"title":"fix(cli): resolve plugin/base Prisma mo